<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>Cross.CQRS</id>
    <version>0.0.0</version>
    <authors>Denis Peshkov</authors>
    <owners>Denis Peshkov</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS.git" />
    <icon>icon.png</icon>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <copyright>Copyright 2026 Denis Peshkov</copyright>
    <license type="file">LICENSE.md</license>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Simple .NET MediatR base Query, Command, CommandEvent and CommandEventQueueProcess behavior. RequestFilter, ResultFilter and Filter behaviours. Event Queue and Validation behaviors. Optional JWT license validation with pluggable product metadata (ILicenseProductInfo).</description>
    <tags>.NET MediatR Query QueryHandler Command CommandHandler CommandEvent CommandEventHandler CommandEventQueueProcessBehavior Filter RequestFilter ResultFilter FilterBehavior Validation ValidationBehavior CQRS License JWT NetCore</tags>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[
Cross.CQRS 11.0.0 — optional JWT licensing (LicenseCheckBehavior), AddCQRS / CqrsServiceConfiguration, TFMs netstandard2.1 + net6–net10, Cross.CQRS.slnx packaging.

Full notes: https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS/blob/master/docs/CHANGELOG.md
Breaking (10.1.x → 11.0.0): https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS/blob/master/docs/BREAKING.md
]]></releaseNotes>
